  "limits": [
    "The independent SDK fixture executes actual Android API DEX on the portable host runtime. Android reference-device PackageManager behavior is grounded in primary API26 source, not claimed from a desktop JVM stub.",
    "No collection of signature/component/permission/time metadata is claimed. Nonzero query flags and unbound fields are explicit unavailable operations.",
    "The preexisting Context.getApplicationInfo flags bitset is a separate incomplete legacy subset. It is not copied into fresh PackageInfo ApplicationInfo and is not validated as a full API26 bitset by this receipt.",
    "Resource-valued versionName and nonliteral SDK/application class-name values remain explicit unsupported inputs; locale/resource resolution is not fabricated.",
    "Metadata queries do not repeat full APK hashing/signature verification performed by the execution load path. They validate committed record consistency, container size, and actual manifest identity/version.",
    "Only the already mounted running APK can expose sourceDir. Cross-package readonly APK mounts and updated-running-process remounting remain unavailable.",
    "Typed NameNotFoundException delivery/message semantics are tested. Public Java constructors, stack traces, causes, and the complete exception ecosystem are not newly advertised.",
    "Latest original external APKs have not yet been rerun with this implementation. No Candy Crush/Mekorama first screen, gameplay, or physical Switch compatibility claim is made by this host receipt.",
    "The earlier frozen-fixtures directory contains pre-SDK-default historical bytes. The final tested artifacts for E2E are exclusively frozen-fixtures-after-sdk-default."
